---
layout: base.njk
langue: en
permalink: /en/
alternate: /
bodyClass: accueil
title: French bistro in Paris 16th, near the Eiffel Tower
description: "Les Coltineurs, a neighbourhood French bistro at 97 avenue de Versailles, Paris 16th (metro Mirabeau), near the Eiffel Tower. Seasonal cooking by Gabin, wines from small growers chosen by Nicolas."
jsonld: restaurant
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__image">
    {% image "salle-coltineurs.jpg", "The dining room at Les Coltineurs: green velvet banquette, wooden tables, old framed pictures and a mosaic floor", "100vw", [640, 1080, 1600, 2400], "eager" %}
  </div>
  <div class="conteneur hero__texte">
    <h1>The bistro on the corner. <em>The one you come back to.</em></h1>
    <p>Les Coltineurs is a neighbourhood restaurant at 97 avenue de Versailles, in Paris 16th, by the Maison de la Radio and not far from the Eiffel Tower. Gabin cooks, Nicolas runs the room, the menu follows the market and the wines come from growers we know.</p>
    <div class="boutons">
      <a class="bouton bouton--plein" href="{{ site.zenchef.reserver }}" rel="noopener">Book a table</a>
      <a class="bouton--lien" href="/en/menu/">See the menu</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="border-top:0">
  <div class="conteneur duo">
    <div class="photo-nb">
      {% image "salle-interieur.jpg", "The dining room at Les Coltineurs, with its banquettes and framed pictures", "(max-width: 52rem) 100vw, 55vw", [480, 800, 1080] %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>The house</h2>
      <p class="grand-texte">Before us, this was an old Auvergnat café, a stone's throw from the Maison de la Radio. We kept the banquettes, the pictures on the walls and the tiled floor. The rest is us.</p>
      <p>Gabin took over in 2019. He is from Brittany, and it shows on the plate: sea and land often meet, as in the razor clams with chorizo or the sweetbreads with blue lobster. Nicolas runs the dining room. He will find you a table, tell you about the winemaker behind your bottle and remember your name next time. Dish names are in French: just ask, we are happy to explain in English.</p>
      <p class="label">Les Coltineurs · 97 avenue de Versailles · Paris 16th</p>
      <a class="lien-fleche" href="{{ site.zenchef.reserver }}" rel="noopener">Book a table</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sable">
  <div class="conteneur">
    <h2 class="centre">A taste of the menu</h2>
    <p class="intro centre" style="margin:0 auto">Just a part of what we are serving right now. The menu changes with the market: click “See the full menu” to see everything.</p>
    {%- set apercu = menu | ardoise(10) %}
    <div class="ardoise">
      <ul class="apercu">
        {%- for p in apercu %}
        <li><span class="nom" lang="fr">{{ p.nom }}</span>{% if p.detail %}<span class="detail" lang="fr">{{ p.detail }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p class="ardoise__note">… and {{ (menu | nbPlats) - apercu.length }} more dishes on the full menu.</p>
      <div class="boutons centre" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <a class="bouton bouton--plein" href="/en/menu/">See the full menu</a>
        <a class="lien-fleche" href="/en/wine-list/">Wine list</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="conteneur bloc-liste">
    <div>
      <h2>For bigger tables</h2>
      <p class="intro">A birthday, a team dinner, the whole family: the room can be yours any day, lunch or dinner. And to host at home or at the office, our catering service is called Le Homard Volant.</p>
      <a class="lien-fleche" href="/en/private-events/">Private hire</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="lignes">
      <li><a class="titre" href="/en/private-events/">Private hire</a><span class="desc">The whole room, from €1,500</span></li>
      <li><a class="titre" href="/en/private-events/">Group meals</a><span class="desc">Without private hire, tailored menu</span></li>
      <li><a class="titre" href="{{ site.homardVolant }}" rel="noopener">Catering</a><span class="desc">Le Homard Volant, at your place, 2 to 300 guests</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="infos">
  <div class="conteneur bloc-liste">
    <h2>Practical</h2>
    <div class="pratique">
      <div><strong>Tue → Sat</strong><span>lunch and dinner, closed Sunday and Monday</span></div>
      <div><strong>12 – 2:30pm</strong><span>lunch</span></div>
      <div><strong>6:30 – 11pm</strong><span>dinner</span></div>
      <div><strong>Line 10</strong><span>metro Mirabeau or Église d'Auteuil</span></div>
      <div><strong>Online</strong><span>or call <a href="tel:{{ site.telephoneIntl }}">+33 1 45 27 15 74</a> to book</span></div>
      <div><strong>€1,500</strong><span>to book the whole room, any day</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sable">
  <div class="conteneur bloc-liste">
    <div>
      <h2>As seen in</h2>
      <a class="lien-fleche" href="/en/press/">All the press</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="citations">
      {%- for a in presse | batch(4) | first %}{% if a.citation %}
      <li><blockquote lang="{{ a.langue or 'fr' }}">“{{ a.citation }}”</blockquote><cite>{{ a.media }}</cite></li>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sombre">
  <div class="conteneur final">
    <div>
      <h2>A table tonight?</h2>
      <p>Book online in two minutes, or call us on <a href="tel:{{ site.telephoneIntl }}">+33 1 45 27 15 74</a>.</p>
      <div class="boutons">
        <a class="bouton bouton--clair" href="{{ site.zenchef.reserver }}" rel="noopener">Book a table</a>
        <a class="bouton" href="{{ site.carte }}" rel="noopener">Directions</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="final__infos">
      <p>{{ site.adresse.rue }}, {{ site.adresse.codePostal }} {{ site.adresse.ville }}<br>Metro Mirabeau or Église d'Auteuil</p>
      <p>Tuesday to Saturday, 12pm – 2:30pm and 6:30pm – 11pm</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
